description = "Too awkward to socialize, [PAWN_nameDef] found comfort in the production of videos. Oddly, people enjoyed [PAWN_possessive] videos, calling them "perfect sitcom dramas".\n\n[PAWN_nameDef] took advantage of this and broadcast more, ever hopeful that [PAWN_pronoun] would be contacted by the Wizards."
